#. Not really. yCAPTCHA has no ML, no fingerprinting, no behavioral analysis — any bot with off-the-shelf image recognition will walk straight through it. If you need real bot protection, use Cloudflare Turnstile or hCaptcha. yCAPTCHA is for the vibe: your community, your puzzles.
